   "seed": 1540227274,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 961250056,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791431790027,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Drawn from workbench-insight/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent. A question is written first; it owns its script, and a run is that question on one partition (runs/<partition>.sh).\nEach run names its skill. Writing a script never starts a run: the person presses Run.\nGuide, shared by every workbench, holds the method and the papers: Method → Add a method (workbench-insight) · Related Paper → Add a paper (haipipe-discovery).",
   "originalText": "Drawn from workbench-insight/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent. A question is written first; it owns its script, and a run is that question on one partition (runs/<partition>.sh).\nEach run names its skill. Writing a script never starts a run: the person presses Run.\nGuide, shared by every workbench, holds the method and the papers: Method → Add a method (workbench-insight) · Related Paper → Add a paper (haipipe-discovery).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
