   "text": "▸ Data          │                │\n▾ Information   │                │\n  Question 2  ✅│ Task  Funnel   │ How the 13\n  How does each │   rates        │ messages did\n  message do?   │ smsr2v1 ok  ↗  │ salience leads\n                │                │ at 66.06%\n  Question 4  ✅│ Task  Funnel   │ Weekday barely\n                │   rates        │ moves clicks\n▾ Knowledge     │                │\n  Question 2  ✅│ Runs behind it │ Segmenting does\n                │                │ not beat one\n  Question 10 🚫│ —              │ No answer\n▸ Wisdom        │                │",
