   "text": "▾ Data questions         4\n  Question 1                🚫\n  What does the extract hold?\n\n  Question 3                ✅\n  How many reach each step?\n\n▾ Information questions 18\n\n▾ Question 2                ✅\n  How does each message\n  perform?\n\n\n\n  Question 8                🚫\n  Message × medical context?\n\n▾ Knowledge questions   16\n  Question 2                🚫\n  Should messages be\n  segmented?\n\n▾ Wisdom questions       2\n  Question 1                ✅\n  Which messages to exploit?",
   "originalText": "▾ Data questions         4\n  Question 1                🚫\n  What does the extract hold?\n\n  Question 3                ✅\n  How many reach each step?\n\n▾ Information questions 18\n\n▾ Question 2                ✅\n  How does each message\n  perform?\n\n\n\n  Question 8                🚫\n  Message × medical context?\n\n▾ Knowledge questions   16\n  Question 2                🚫\n  Should messages be\n  segmented?\n\n▾ Wisdom questions       2\n  Question 1                ✅\n  Which messages to exploit?",
