   "text": "\n—\n\n\n› Question 3's run\n  1 partition · youngmale · ok\n\n\n\n⌄ Question 2's run\n    2-Information ›\n      I02-variant-performance\n        youngmale  ok   ↗\n\n\n—\n\n\n\n—\n\n\n\n\n—",
   "originalText": "\n—\n\n\n› Question 3's run\n  1 partition · youngmale · ok\n\n\n\n⌄ Question 2's run\n    2-Information ›\n      I02-variant-performance\n        youngmale  ok   ↗\n\n\n—\n\n\n\n—\n\n\n\n\n—",
