   "updated": 1791431790027,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\nAnswered on Full · a property\nof the whole extract\n\nThe funnel in this cut\ncounts at each step, young men only\n\n\n\nHow the 13 messages performed here\nthe same leader as Full; the middle\nnine still cannot be told apart.\n\n\n\nToo few rows · 2 of 34 drug classes\nreach the 300-row floor\n\n\nDefers to Full · asking “segment?”\nfrom inside a segment is circular\n\n\n\nDefers to Full · the Cross verdict\nsays POOL",
   "originalText": "\nAnswered on Full · a property\nof the whole extract\n\nThe funnel in this cut\ncounts at each step, young men only\n\n\n\nHow the 13 messages performed here\nthe same leader as Full; the middle\nnine still cannot be told apart.\n\n\n\nToo few rows · 2 of 34 drug classes\nreach the 300-row floor\n\n\nDefers to Full · asking “segment?”\nfrom inside a segment is circular\n\n\n\nDefers to Full · the Cross verdict\nsays POOL",
