  {
   "id": "s-ac3e87e4f828",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 72,
   "y": 4021.75,
   "width": 647.36,
   "height": 340.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-833a54481899",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 17278680,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1318345829,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791431790027,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The workbench is born from one extract: MT00 names it, the banner\n   shows it on every Space, and there is no dataset switcher.\n\n2. A partition is a cut of that extract, never a second dataset:\n   0-Meta/partitions.md names its filter; a run is one partition.\n\n3. Each question owns its code: the Prototype holds the question\n   and its script, the Instance a tracked copy of the script\n   (prototype.lock; a difference shows as ⚑).\n\n4. A run is runs/<partition>.sh in the question's own folder:\n   its results/ and reports/ answer that question only.\n\n5. A new extract is a new Instance of the same Prototype. Round 3\n   checking round 2 is a comparison between two Instances,\n   not a partition of either.",
   "originalText": "1. The workbench is born from one extract: MT00 names it, the banner\n   shows it on every Space, and there is no dataset switcher.\n\n2. A partition is a cut of that extract, never a second dataset:\n   0-Meta/partitions.md names its filter; a run is one partition.\n\n3. Each question owns its code: the Prototype holds the question\n   and its script, the Instance a tracked copy of the script\n   (prototype.lock; a difference shows as ⚑).\n\n4. A run is runs/<partition>.sh in the question's own folder:\n   its results/ and reports/ answer that question only.\n\n5. A new extract is a new Instance of the same Prototype. Round 3\n   checking round 2 is a comparison between two Instances,\n   not a partition of either.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-59d30a896190",
