   "text": "Prototype-Insight-SMS/2-Information/I04-temporal-dynamics/\n├── I04-temporal-dynamics.md      question · ask · needs · specs\n└── scripts/temporal_dynamics.py  SPEC = \"I04\" · run(df, ctx)\n0-Meta/partitions.md\n│     youngmale: gender = M · age ≤ 35           ← the cut\n0-Meta/thresholds.yaml  floors · power.smallest_effect_pp\nInstance: a copy of scripts/ + prototype.lock (⚑ if they differ)\n\nthe question owns its code; no task, no config, no answers:",
