   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791431790027,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The ticket's name is the partition: runs/<partition>.sh writes results/<partition>/ and reports/<partition>/.   2. The cut lives in partitions.md, the code in the question's scripts/.\n3. The receipt is written before the work and finalized after the gate: spec, scripts and shared files by sha256.   4. A rerun replaces its result; a changed spec or script makes it STALE.",
   "originalText": "1. The ticket's name is the partition: runs/<partition>.sh writes results/<partition>/ and reports/<partition>/.   2. The cut lives in partitions.md, the code in the question's scripts/.\n3. The receipt is written before the work and finalized after the gate: spec, scripts and shared files by sha256.   4. A rerun replaces its result; a changed spec or script makes it STALE.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
