   "locked": false,
   "text": "Design drawing: illustrative states from A00 (SMSR2v1), not live data. Generated by studio/insight-workbench-design.py; edit that file, then run it.",
   "originalText": "Design drawing: illustrative states from A00 (SMSR2v1), not live data. Generated by studio/insight-workbench-design.py; edit that file, then run it.",
