   "updated": 1791431790027,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a carried question keeps its words: question, name, ask,\nwhy now, what would answer it, every need (carry_over.py)\n\na new question gets:\n  question   the short wording a reader scans\n  ask        one thing, in plain words\n  level      D · I · K · W; a D or I ask states no cause\n  why now    who waits on the answer, and what it replicates\n  answer     what would answer it, then its needs\n  partitions asked where it means the same, and why not elsewhere\n\nthe shaper plans from the question and the column list;\nit never reads results to fit a question to them",
   "originalText": "a carried question keeps its words: question, name, ask,\nwhy now, what would answer it, every need (carry_over.py)\n\na new question gets:\n  question   the short wording a reader scans\n  ask        one thing, in plain words\n  level      D · I · K · W; a D or I ask states no cause\n  why now    who waits on the answer, and what it replicates\n  answer     what would answer it, then its needs\n  partitions asked where it means the same, and why not elsewhere\n\nthe shaper plans from the question and the column list;\nit never reads results to fit a question to them",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
