   "text": "role       who                        does                        never\n\nasker      a person, or the insight   raises a raw ask from a     answers it\n           agent from a source        source above\nshaper     haipipe-insight-agent      shapes a new question;      reads results to\n           (haipipe-insight-question) keeps a carried one's words fit the question\nreviewer   haipipe-insight-reviewer-  judges Q1-Q7, proposes      reviews what it\n           agent                      keep, split, merge, move    shaped\nsigner     the person                 signs each proposed change  writes the spec\n\nthe person owns the list; the agents propose and check",
   "originalText": "role       who                        does                        never\n\nasker      a person, or the insight   raises a raw ask from a     answers it\n           agent from a source        source above\nshaper     haipipe-insight-agent      shapes a new question;      reads results to\n           (haipipe-insight-question) keeps a carried one's words fit the question\nreviewer   haipipe-insight-reviewer-  judges Q1-Q7, proposes      reviews what it\n           agent                      keep, split, merge, move    shaped\nsigner     the person                 signs each proposed change  writes the spec\n\nthe person owns the list; the agents propose and check",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
